sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor U as Presenter
 participant A as Feedback host
 participant API as Django services
 participant W as Celery worker
 Note over U,W: 5B. Edits, invalidation and safe retries | Unmerged PR21
 U->>A: Edit a slide description and Save
 A->>API: PATCH /api/decks/{id}/descriptions/<br/>set ID + description_revision + content
 alt Source/revision conflict
  API-->>A: Conflict, no overwrite
  A-->>U: Retain draft, offer reload
 else Current revision matches
  API->>API: Validate and store edit,<br/>increment description + processing revisions
  API-->>A: Updated descriptions and revision
  A->>API: Read feedback
  API-->>A: Old feedback marked stale<br/>by revision comparison
  A-->>U: Show stale label, disable evidence seek
  Note over API,W: Stale worker writes cannot replace newer edits.<br/>Regeneration requires an explicit user action.
 end
 opt Generation failed or interrupted
  A->>API: Refresh dependency/feedback state
  API-->>A: Stage, retry availability,<br/>revision and confirmation requirement
  opt Unknown submitted outcome
   A-->>U: Explain uncertain provider outcome
   U->>A: Confirm before retry (or cancel)
  end
  alt Authorized retry, descriptions failed
   U->>A: Retry slide descriptions
   A->>API: POST descriptions/generate/<br/>own processing_revision
   Note over API,W: Waiting coaching follows the dependency.<br/>Retry descriptions at their own endpoint.
  else Authorized retry, coaching failed / stale feedback
   U->>A: Retry or regenerate feedback
   A->>API: POST feedback/generate/<br/>current feedback_revision
  end
  Note over U,API: Cancellation sends no retry request.<br/>Confirmed retries include acknowledge_uncertain.
  API-)W: Admit eligible generation via Redis
  Note right of W: Retain provider receipts.<br/>Reuse received output.<br/>Wait for quota when needed.<br/>Beat triggers safe recovery.
 end
 Note over API,W: Evidence checks source, visit, time and quotes.<br/>Unsupported cards are removed.<br/>All-invalid output fails.
